// Schema for Custos policies. Validated against every *.cedar file in this
// directory by `custos check-policy` and on every policy (re)load — an
// unknown context attribute, or one used with the wrong type, is an error
// here rather than silently doing nothing at decision time.
//
// Keep this in sync with crates/custos-policy/src/lib.rs (build_context)
// and crates/custos-inspect/src/lib.rs (Kind).

entity Agent;
entity Tool;

action call_tool appliesTo {
    principal: [Agent],
    resource: [Tool],
    context: {
        // Kinds of sensitive content custos-inspect found in this call's
        // arguments, e.g. "iban", "card", "cnp", "steuer_id", "email",
        // "api_key". Never the matched values themselves.
        findings: Set<String>,
        // Serialized size of the arguments, in bytes.
        args_bytes: Long,
        // The longest array anywhere in the arguments (0 if none).
        array_max_len: Long,
        // 0-23, UTC, at decision time.
        hour_utc: Long,
        // 0 = Monday .. 6 = Sunday, UTC, at decision time.
        weekday: Long,
    }
};
